
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="id">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>HAANS VGRAPHER | Visual Storyteller</title>
  <style>
    * {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    html {
      scroll-behavior: smooth;
    }

    body {
      background: #090909;
      color: #f5f5f5;
      font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.7;
    }

    nav {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      padding: 24px 8%;
      border-bottom: 1px solid #252525;
    }

    .logo {
      font-size: 18px;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 3px;
    }

    nav a {
      color: #aaa;
      text-decoration: none;
      margin-left: 22px;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 1px;
    }

    nav a:hover {
      color: white;
    }

    .hero {
      min-height: 78vh;
      padding: 100px 8%;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 75% 35%, #252525 0%, #090909 60%);
    }

    .eyebrow {
      color: #aaa;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1 {
      font-size: clamp(48px, 9vw, 100px);
      line-height: 1.05;
      letter-spacing: -4px;
      margin: 24px 0;
    }

    h1 span {
      color: #888;
    }

    .hero p {
      max-width: 500px;
      color: #aaa;
      margin-bottom: 32px;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      width: fit-content;
      padding: 12px 22px;
      border: 1px solid #777;
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 12px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      transition: 0.25s;
    }

    .button:hover {
      background: white;
      color: black;
    }

    section {
      padding: 85px 8%;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
    }

    .section-label {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 4px;
      margin-bottom: 14px;
    }

    h2 {
      font-size: clamp(30px, 5vw, 48px);
      margin-bottom: 24px;
    }

    .work-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 18px;
      margin-top: 35px;
    }

    .work {
      min-height: 220px;
      padding: 25px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: flex-end;
      background: linear-gradient(145deg, #292929, #101010 70%);
      border: 1px solid #303030;
    }

    .work span {
      color: #888;
      font-size: 11px;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
    }

    .work h3 {
      font-size: 23px;
      margin-top: 8px;
    }

    .about-text {
      max-width: 650px;
      color: #aaa;
    }

    .contact-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 14px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 25px;
    }

    footer {
      padding: 25px 8%;
      border-top: 1px solid #222;
      color: #777;
      font-size: 12px;
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 12px;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
    }

    @media (max-width: 600px) {
      nav {
        padding: 20px 6%;
      }

      nav a {
        margin-left: 10px;
        font-size: 10px;
      }

      .hero {
        padding: 80px 6%;
      }

      h1 {
        letter-spacing: -2px;
      }

      section {
        padding: 65px 6%;
      }

      .work-grid {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav>
    <div class="logo">HAANS<span style="color:#777">.</span></div>
    <div>
      <a href="#works">WORKS</a>
      <a href="#about">ABOUT</a>
      <a href="#contact">CONTACT</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="eyebrow">Videographer · Video Editor</div>
    <h1>HAANS<br><span>VGRAPHER.</span></h1>
    <p>
      Capturing moments, creating emotions.
      Visual storytelling through the art of cinematic video.
    </p>
    <a class="button" href="#works">EXPLORE MY WORK ↘</a>
  </header>

  <section id="works">
    <div class="section-label">01 / SELECTED WORKS</div>
    <h2>My Visual Stories.</h2>
    <p class="about-text">
      A collection of moments, stories, and visuals captured through my lens.
      More cinematic projects coming soon.
    </p>

    <div class="work-grid">
      <article class="work">
        <span>01 — CINEMATIC</span>
        <h3>Cinematic Stories</h3>
      </article>
      <article class="work">
        <span>02 — EVENT</span>
        <h3>Event Highlights</h3>
      </article>
      <article class="work">
        <span>03 — DOCUMENTARY</span>
        <h3>Real Moments</h3>
      </article>
      <article class="work">
        <span>04 — CREATIVE</span>
        <h3>Visual Experiments</h3>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section id="about">
    <div class="section-label">02 / ABOUT ME</div>
    <h2>Behind The Lens.</h2>
    <p class="about-text">
      I'm Haans, a videographer and video editor passionate about
      cinematic visuals and meaningful storytelling. I create videos
      that turn ordinary moments into memorable stories, using creativity
      and the tools I have.
    </p>
  </section>

  <section id="contact">
    <div class="section-label">03 / GET IN TOUCH</div>
    <h2>Let's Create<br>Something Great.</h2>
    <p class="about-text">
      Have a project or a story to tell? Let's connect and make it happen.
    </p>
    <div class="contact-links">
      <a class="button" href="https://www.instagram.com/hans_vgrapher/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">INSTAGRAM ↗</a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <span>© 2026 HAANS VGRAPHER</span>
    <span>MADE WITH CREATIVITY.</span>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
